msgid "Flux AI chat and MCP clients (Claude and others) read stats with: flxan_summary, flxan_timeseries, flxan_pages, flxan_referrers, flxan_breakdown, flxan_events, flxan_realtime, flxan_page, flxan_compare, flxan_funnel, flxan_journeys, flxan_refs, flxan_ref_save. Access needs the \"View statistics\" capability (flxan_view), which Flux Roles can grant."
msgstr "Os clientes Flux AI chat e MCP (Claude e outros) leem estatísticas com: flxan_summary, flxan_timeseries, flxan_pages, flxan_referrers, flxan_breakdown, flxan_events, flxan_realtime, flxan_page, flxan_compare, flxan_funnel, flxan_journeys, flxan_refs, flxan_ref_save. O acesso precisa do recurso \"Visualizar estatísticas\" (flxan_view), que o Flux Roles pode conceder."

